{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "66ca6e69f5ef0127695996e6600cdb486c523aca6a43d9332837b4ed642196c8",
  "bundle_request_count": 17,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:05db35c89515570b9f55f636b4624f56c9d0e130c2828cb1d0e3f0148304fb93",
      "request_id": "05db35c89515570b9f55f636b4624f56c9d0e130c2828cb1d0e3f0148304fb93",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0d2579212ca1fd9136fe0e55c14423f1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "兹维列夫对霍达尔一比零，但那是今年法网的红土。谢尔顿对菲斯二比一，两场胜利都在室内硬帝。不过他们自二零二四年以后没有再碰面，旧记录不能代表今年的差距。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e91d63e33d0df2490ad1d734af0721bdd9ddc7a356e4c1059eb3ca97824fd20f",
      "words_sha256": "3795cf8c4a874368d314ececeece89e97a44de9fb756e1b2c7c79509680f0f05"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0796d0ac0a46aa27aea351b86c4f45837f38229d8840e4a35c1df00e301edd4a",
      "request_id": "0796d0ac0a46aa27aea351b86c4f45837f38229d8840e4a35c1df00e301edd4a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4cf2219a840f70be71b1cbe0440833a1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿卡对蒂亚福二比一，但最近交手是二零二四年温网。梅德韦德夫对科博利二比一，今年马德里却输了。科博利已经能赢过他，不过红土的胜利也不能照搬到都灵。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3cb7164e7cfb0c6fbe13caa0c25d929f82fe0839f683988def238adadb7c7a79",
      "words_sha256": "60c6d9e835acad58dffd2c2c74f9f46b2b7e736c9fb2a15c961f91daa9bb17e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2cff0ad231215e02d579cb9ba15c034d51a86958faff617f04380ea53409e015",
      "request_id": "2cff0ad231215e02d579cb9ba15c034d51a86958faff617f04380ea53409e015",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8ebb13c7aa130a0f6c55a6646dca717d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "再看赛季。兹维列夫拿下法网和美网，已经锁定年终第一，还有两次年终夺冠经验。我把他放在麦肯罗组第一顺位。理由是大赛成绩与组内交锋同时支持，而不是只凭排名。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "65971a2df89c92409864044c51bb2d591f694174fddfb68e95ffc9f191230bc6",
      "words_sha256": "5c48f342e94f8d985dcdb5cccb13820bbdf1bcd6c92ad94242c499fbd98070f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:36fa3ff9c7ea6aed9dde12ffe7ff1bb6873e6d2f431535818fd9108d878635f5",
      "request_id": "36fa3ff9c7ea6aed9dde12ffe7ff1bb6873e6d2f431535818fd9108d878635f5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a27415a7f214788ca0379ca5108cd628",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "谢尔顿和霍达尔还没交过手。霍达尔却对菲斯二比一领先，今年在华盛顿和蒙特利尔连续赢了他。这个小组的第二名，我偏向谢尔顿，但霍达尔有直接搅局的依据。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2781723eaf565b499f64bb7b5e176f3de3a8915d270c6c3b8f8fe88edb490a5e",
      "words_sha256": "9186f960c5d1fb3b30b19c78b32a6273071cd9257ff85f4bf50dc394564edb1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:377af10bcce03b255f2abfad85cbd0613625a74572d490349fe65d92027ac11b",
      "request_id": "377af10bcce03b255f2abfad85cbd0613625a74572d490349fe65d92027ac11b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "aa3af4eeade308447e6475722f60fed8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "兹维列夫是世界第一，阿卡刚拿维也纳和巴黎两冠。今年年终，我更看好谁？先看十二组交锋，再看八个人的赛季和近况，最后给出四强和冠军选择。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "46cfe2b9d807669c43096ca66d21c40c5f70e165d54f68f4627c949288904bfb",
      "words_sha256": "6324386fbe33849819ece6a4efef9e187bede63a4e34fbcf7ee02357a1124797"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:487f5e0c8d0874e72150abf5c4b5d6b9d8aa0b04a9ad7b2c09e428180d18d24c",
      "request_id": "487f5e0c8d0874e72150abf5c4b5d6b9d8aa0b04a9ad7b2c09e428180d18d24c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "33f2c95e809515b3dea57c5c919e901f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿卡对梅德韦德夫七比三，今年两人各赢一场。阿卡对科博利一比零，可唯一那场还是二零二三年法网。一个是今年有来有回，一个是样本太旧，都不能只看总数。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "87fea87eb93c7b3761383b25eb960ada273f2486d04f5c211158974c572c1c99",
      "words_sha256": "d218b4850a3ed48215397cdeecf20872290d9b22d99f775558faf1b285342257"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4fce0df438fd3a449a4620263c1e37b490660901212cd051b16e3bdfe4b01a04",
      "request_id": "4fce0df438fd3a449a4620263c1e37b490660901212cd051b16e3bdfe4b01a04",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0db09a59908f2c617c9ed5600431847f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "冠军我选阿卡，第二选择是兹维列夫。兹维列夫的全年成绩更硬，阿卡最近的室内表现更热。我的取舍，是把近期在同类场地的表现放在前面。如果出现疲劳或身体问题，这个判断就需要调整。你会把谁换进四强？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "581fedf39a90c72a787d2ec5ba07954f99a399eb4b9d07d55cc4a8c3f61df243",
      "words_sha256": "f2eabe1f27d12ceb36089ec607fff1b8c6b7780a712e6e54fb211f37925f1a92"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6b574554cb0594d99db2eb85a618169b0e8bc5d37fd35b94762221cf081c23ba",
      "request_id": "6b574554cb0594d99db2eb85a618169b0e8bc5d37fd35b94762221cf081c23ba",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4d46e14ee75e670976c51bd67fe5cadd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "伦德尔组，阿卡是我的第一选择。他今年五冠，最近在维也纳、巴黎连续夺冠，带着室内九连胜来到都灵。相比年初的成绩，这段最近发生的室内表现，更直接支持我看好他。但他去年是亚军，年终冠军这一步还要自己完成。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e64dc60a612ef96074fee4b7644301d8760bfef5e7c9ed506a428354db0cad4b",
      "words_sha256": "0a7daa42c0b26491ed8498be15ef19408a6eb1575c87074ec66c2143d39b6dd9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7303afe4ed5c3ebafa2c8a46730bee6e30395e20e94ad08d0cde2a38d34d803c",
      "request_id": "7303afe4ed5c3ebafa2c8a46730bee6e30395e20e94ad08d0cde2a38d34d803c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2c5f39eeaf839b7d109309723fe1ea86",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "梅德韦德夫今年四冠，十月刚拿阿拉木图室内冠军，随后在维也纳进了四强。再加上二零二零年年终冠军的经验，我把他放在组内第二顺位。但蒂亚福最近赢过他，今年又输过科博利，他需要在直接对话里守住这个位置。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "73f532798c8ac26c7df7fe9ff2031ae353311b4592c9c20140fb7dc316529849",
      "words_sha256": "626e8d47f4c725847c3b03c7c8013d4e0f65e248ad9ffceac7d2421ff10af795"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8708c856d607e7823f734f28f67217eb95288a7a0c5aa379f148b37f05de1f51",
      "request_id": "8708c856d607e7823f734f28f67217eb95288a7a0c5aa379f148b37f05de1f51",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4f92d93471fe50ca24f53e7a4f6f9c95",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "菲斯今年拿下巴塞罗那和辛辛那提，辛辛那提是他的首座大师赛冠军。他当然有爆发力。但这组里，他对兹维列夫、谢尔顿、霍达尔的总交锋都落后。我的判断是，有冲击力，出线仍排在谢尔顿之后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "03537ba640d5bc1e0641abec1d05faa75276ad308e1dc873f176b1a90d99cf6d",
      "words_sha256": "0006452c9098e14555833500924d06f62c2f7c8443b20072ffb50f9603602908"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:913c050107f45398af7cd3640a42f5ee616ce1d85b7c818a7345ddd78ad3b615",
      "request_id": "913c050107f45398af7cd3640a42f5ee616ce1d85b7c818a7345ddd78ad3b615",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "75e869f4e62a97b1b0ff3f22cc018ced",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四强我选兹维列夫、谢尔顿、阿卡、梅德韦德夫。麦肯罗组最防霍达尔搅局，伦德尔组最防蒂亚福替换梅德韦德夫。这是结合交锋和近期状态的个人判断，不是四个人已经锁定出线。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d8af982846dd44318877d4a773de75d6e2735e7ec2ad2399fbc3c4cfdf3d4f8a",
      "words_sha256": "40666b8d4e13166f8a4397ddc2378a18f7336ce58adbf2bebcea8047b96aa6b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a75efa4dcd59ef9d25ef8332a9f6ad1be1bacf057d3b64274ce3eb644049830e",
      "request_id": "a75efa4dcd59ef9d25ef8332a9f6ad1be1bacf057d3b64274ce3eb644049830e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "25b392799f03ff48374fed4bf22ac54b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "谢尔顿今年四冠，美网和巴黎都进了决赛。巴黎刚输给阿卡，说明他有竞争力，也说明最后一步还没跨过。去年年终三战全负，所以我选他出线，依据是今年的提升，不是已经证明的年终表现。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "eebee00ddf65fe61a53d55e330e6a7369c5ce45b611b401f793ae23d7587a036",
      "words_sha256": "15fea79cdaf5d8811bc8c6f04cc975c1ae05d959e797ecf7f62fb15a58a8ff4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:bb387d8289f3ed7389589ea9fcc37587e76695f917175f9ee5e6f644ca847541",
      "request_id": "bb387d8289f3ed7389589ea9fcc37587e76695f917175f9ee5e6f644ca847541",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a9011222a7584100ad9b9e7585f3565b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "梅德韦德夫对蒂亚福六比二，可最近三场输了两场，今年美网也输了。蒂亚福对科博利四比一，今年虽然输掉阿卡普尔科决赛，随后两次又都赢了。梅德韦德夫这个出线位，并不保险。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4dc524a1b60eb66970fc3a4bef24db94c7a4e42bf1bf18a54dcdf5b110f482de",
      "words_sha256": "d057f8af65b8093bf6ed1e3b52c65f6a25548e8cf438e99c7fd0427b36919c7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e260b416d686c0cce2f7e6a37e90c331103b8f045c0172d7e1dbf51d3f905fb4",
      "request_id": "e260b416d686c0cce2f7e6a37e90c331103b8f045c0172d7e1dbf51d3f905fb4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "97e9e1212e7359617b7e2b9ecde9bb78",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "蒂亚福今年在哈雷夺冠，辛辛那提进决赛，美网进四强。我最防他挤掉梅德韦德夫，因为今年美网直接赢过，而且对科博利总交锋四比一。我的排序仍是梅德韦德夫略前，但这个位置，远没有阿卡那一席稳。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bf9919a456115603368c74e822b77b4d048874f92e11cdcc1526253ffabc8965",
      "words_sha256": "56dfc707625f9a0c89d530ce0fad966c36f808b902ed9aff27f04c5b7b87d66c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f3e8f2e47ce2f0ec63aedd2063055043d6a34456b3b8e50ae3802704316b6310",
      "request_id": "f3e8f2e47ce2f0ec63aedd2063055043d6a34456b3b8e50ae3802704316b6310",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a49d26c1fa20ccd43f7350051a4a7d25",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "霍达尔今年拿到马拉喀什冠军，还打进上海决赛。他已在硬帝赢过菲斯两次，不能因为初次参赛就低估。但对兹维列夫唯一一场输了，对谢尔顿还没打过；我看好他制造悬念，暂不把他放进四强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6298dc311a042996d150470eb4bfa3cb637e00a2a6506756a87429b071128af1",
      "words_sha256": "bd399dc97f5e9887a07dc68d3c269a6f18efc1117b8b75de6095888bbc5d6311"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f51934068fc9d86e77e33334f09eb63db54e9eb22190ce7a2dfeca7f72146430",
      "request_id": "f51934068fc9d86e77e33334f09eb63db54e9eb22190ce7a2dfeca7f72146430",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "adb2dc8e79cf4b2ad5920118a463f4ec",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "兹维列夫对谢尔顿六比零，对菲斯五比二。今年美网决赛，他又赢了谢尔顿。历史对位明显偏向兹维列夫，但美网是五盘赛，不能直接等同于年终的三盘赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c54693d69f99c3ee4636eb2d3212d104c0e66c02cca094d2f833ac6549d555eb",
      "words_sha256": "f1bfc65e9b98c50bb7a89fc5c668c8fe1ada216c399d9f81a006dcd3de02955e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fb680b19d8b0aff515d31bad8c49680122f25c98a97bfbb6fd8e7d4519e16af0",
      "request_id": "fb680b19d8b0aff515d31bad8c49680122f25c98a97bfbb6fd8e7d4519e16af0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "24682b2be811946cf2faed668fd0534e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "科博利拿下阿卡普尔科，还打进法网决赛。这些成绩证明他有资格站在这里。但法网是红土；到了都灵，主场支持也不能替他赢球。我把他列为搅局者，关键看能否把今年对梅德韦德夫的胜利，带到室内硬帝。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e08b5cdff225eaf858ec837e768a250b893cdf7765692dbf8ed155d250b27406",
      "words_sha256": "4290a6a5bd9c6fe2b19e6cd4c2c59fefb93d565c44985270c1c38a0c4f242820"
    }
  ]
}
